# Defense-in-depth: catch credential files anywhere in the repo, even if a
# subproject's own .gitignore misses one. Subprojects (backend/, dashboard/,
# mobile-app/) have their own more complete .gitignore files for build
# artifacts, node_modules, etc. — this is just the secrets backstop.
**/creds/
**/*firebase-adminsdk*.json
**/google-services.json
**/GoogleService-Info.plist
**/*.pem
**/*.key
.env
.env.local
